# Git guesses whether a file is text, and it guessed wrong about the hand-built PDF in
# tests/fixtures: a PDF's cross-reference table stores absolute byte offsets, so rewriting its
# line endings on checkout moves every offset and the file stops parsing. The Office fixtures
# are zip archives, which the same treatment would flatten just as thoroughly.
* text=auto

*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.zip  binary
